min strict one-turn margin(rad) = 0.09498
min strict adjacent-lower margin(rad) = 0.0465138
min strict adjacent-upper margin(rad) = 0.0811253
PASS: exact contraction certificates place a regular collapsed closure root inside 35 of the 42 rotation-cell symmetry orbits.
```

The printed decimal values are descriptive conversions of quantities whose pass/fail comparisons were performed as exact rationals.

